{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JAS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"雅各書","commonName":"雅各書","title":"雅各書","order":59,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"7a64cf42f1727ff1a85200e8384ebd3bc7441abdc8ae16cc66e9307519ba6b19","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JAS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JAS/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":108},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["不可與世俗為友"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你們中間的爭戰鬥毆是從哪裏來的呢？不是從你們百體中戰鬥之私慾來的嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你們貪戀，還是得不着；你們殺害嫉妒，又鬥毆爭戰，也不能得。你們得不着，是因為你們不求。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你們求也得不着，是因為你們妄求，要浪費在你們的宴樂中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你們這些淫亂的人",{"noteId":1},"哪，豈不知與世俗為友就是與上帝為敵嗎？所以凡想要與世俗為友的，就是與上帝為敵了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你們想經上所說是徒然的嗎？上帝所賜、住在我們裏面的靈，是戀愛至於嫉妒嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但他賜更多的恩典，所以經上說：",{"text":"上帝阻擋驕傲的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜恩給謙卑的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["故此，你們要順服上帝。務要抵擋魔鬼，魔鬼就必離開你們逃跑了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你們親近上帝，上帝就必親近你們。有罪的人哪，要潔淨你們的手！心懷二意的人哪，要清潔你們的心！"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你們要愁苦、悲哀、哭泣，將喜笑變作悲哀，歡樂變作愁悶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["務要在主面前自卑，主就必叫你們升高。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不可論斷弟兄"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["弟兄們，你們不可彼此批評。人若批評弟兄，論斷弟兄，就是批評律法，論斷律法。你若論斷律法，就不是遵行律法，乃是判斷人的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["設立律法和判斷人的，只有一位，就是那能救人也能滅人的。你是誰，竟敢論斷別人呢？"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警戒自誇"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["嗐！你們有話說：「今天明天我們要往某城裏去，在那裏住一年，做買賣得利。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["其實明天如何，你們還不知道。你們的生命是甚麼呢？你們原來是一片雲霧，出現少時就不見了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你們只當說：「主若願意，我們就可以活着，也可以做這事，或做那事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["現今你們竟以張狂誇口；凡這樣誇口都是惡的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["人若知道行善，卻不去行，這就是他的罪了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"原文是淫婦","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JAS/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JAS/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JAS/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}